---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Non-Affiliation Notice" description="WasmStore is an independent browser-game directory and is not affiliated with game publishers or trademark owners unless expressly stated." path="/non-affiliation">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT BROWSER ARCADE</div><h1>Non-affiliation <span class="gradient-text">notice</span></h1><p>Clear information about ownership, trademarks, and third-party links.</p></div></section>
  <article class="prose wrap">
    <h2>Independent project</h2>
    <p>WasmStore is an independent, unofficial directory for discovering browser-playable games, web ports, and community projects. Unless a page expressly states otherwise, WasmStore is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or officially connected to any game developer, publisher, platform, or trademark owner featured in the directory.</p>
    <h2>Names and trademarks</h2>
    <p>Game titles, logos, character names, trademarks, and related intellectual property belong to their respective owners. Names are used only to identify and describe the relevant games or projects. Their appearance on WasmStore does not imply a partnership, authorization, or endorsement.</p>
    <h2>Third-party projects and links</h2>
    <p>Some listings link to third-party demos, repositories, or services. Those projects and services are operated independently and may have their own terms, licenses, privacy policies, and technical requirements. Visitors should review the relevant source and license information before using, modifying, or redistributing any software or game assets.</p>
    <h2>Corrections and rights requests</h2>
    <p>If you believe a listing is inaccurate or raises a rights concern, please visit the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> or read our <a href="/copyright">Copyright and takedown policy</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
